 member (vocalist)\nHe is a smoker and a drinker.\nHe has a scar on his left side.\n\nPlease see the attached document for the appearance.\n\n◆Composition, facial expression, etc.\n\nIt is up to you.\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if the left and right sides of the person are not cut off.\n\nIt would also be greatly appreciated if you could separate the background and human figure layers, considering the possibility of using them as thumbnails in the future.\nEither a transparent background png or layered PSD would be fine.\n\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\nX\nhttps://twitter.com/usa_akira_v\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Y4Ia7P2jxNkJA2uKQt9XV1QoM5fLoPKO?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@BrockenYoshida/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2545934, "client_id": 1973802, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cad9642b/uploads/origins/776779a4-525a-4718-9eaa-20c4776e251f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=708cdb798e51bceafc9e08045beb8147", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cad9642b/uploads/origins/776779a4-525a-4718-9eaa-20c4776e251f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=708cdb798e51bceafc9e08045beb8147, https://si.imgix.net/cad9642b/uploads/origins/776779a4-525a-4718-9eaa-20c4776e251f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5787100e5fdba8d94361d834ab60bfc6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cad9642b/uploads/origins/776779a4-525a-4718-9eaa-20c4776e251f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fca6ec53aff0fc8223a159326f18bd88 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cad9642b/uploads/origins/776779a4-525a-4718-9eaa-20c4776e251f?bg=%2